   "widgets_values": [
    "jeskv, A cinematic ultrawide film still: a vast, empty old-world street at golden hour, exactly four young men standing in a row side by side, a group shot framing all four characters together, all whole bodies in view with plenty of space around them.\nStyle: moody cinematic film still, anamorphic look, subtle film grain, realistic photograph.\nLighting: warm low-angle golden-hour sunlight raking across the street, long shadows, soft rim light on all four of their hair and shoulders.\nFraming: extreme wide shot, 21:9 ultrawide, eye-level camera, shallow depth of field on the background, all four figures clearly separated and fully visible in a single line.\nMedium: 35mm anamorphic film.\nPalette: warm amber and teal shadows, dusty gold highlights.\nBackground: a long empty old-world street with weathered buildings receding into soft haze, gentle atmospheric depth.\nThe four subjects standing in a row from left to right: first,  a young Indian man in his mid-twenties with short neat black hair, a full short dense black beard, dark brown eyes, lean slim build, wearing a plain white t-shirt and dark trousers; second (MAIN FOCUS),  a young Indian man in his mid-twenties with medium wavy black hair falling to eyebrow length, slightly crooked naturally bent nose, dark brown almond eyes, thin lips, clean-shaven with faint stubble, lean slim build, wearing a plain black t-shirt; third,  a young Indian man in his mid-twenties with neat short black hair, clean-shaven, dark brown eyes, lean slim build, wearing a plain blue t-shirt and dark trousers; fourth,  a young Indian man in his mid-twenties with short black hair and light stubble, dark brown eyes, lean slim build, wearing a plain yellow t-shirt and dark trousers.\nAll four standing still, looking toward the camera with calm expressions, a relaxed friendship between them.\nEXACTLY four men total in the entire frame, one in each of the four positions. No other people anywhere. NOT five men, NOT three men. No duplicates."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "dlor, jeskv, A cinematic ultrawide film still: two young men standing side by side in a vast, empty old-world street at golden hour, a two-shot framing both characters together, both whole bodies in view with plenty of space around them.\nStyle: moody cinematic film still, anamorphic look, subtle film grain, realistic photograph.\nLighting: warm low-angle golden-hour sunlight raking across the street, long shadows, soft rim light on both of their hair and shoulders.\nFraming: extreme wide shot, 21:9 ultrawide, eye-level camera, shallow depth of field on the background, both figures clearly separated and fully visible.\nMedium: 35mm anamorphic film.\nPalette: warm amber and teal shadows, dusty gold highlights.\nBackground: a long empty old-world street with weathered buildings receding into soft haze, gentle atmospheric depth.\nThe two subjects: on the left, a young man in his mid-twenties with short neat black hair, a full short dense black beard, dark brown eyes, lean slim build, wearing a plain white t-shirt and dark trousers; on the right, a young man in his mid-twenties with medium wavy black hair falling to eyebrow length, slightly crooked naturally bent nose, dark brown almond eyes, thin lips, clean-shaven with faint stubble, lean slim build, wearing a plain black t-shirt. Both standing still, looking toward the camera with calm expressions, a relaxed friendship between them.\nONLY TWO characters, no other people, no duplicates, no third person."
   },
   "color": "#009933",
   "bgcolor": "#353"
  },
